This number is the size of generation 1. We shall call it <M>X_1</M>. Let the distribution of <M>X_1</M>  be
given by <M>P(X_1=k) = p_k</M>  for <M>k=0,1,2,...</M>. Obviously, <M>\sum_0^\infty p_k = 1.</M>
